bzip2: reading and writing of bzip2 compressed files and strings,
with the bzip2 library of the base system.

The module bz2 of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/bz2.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/bz2.
